Package: mica-mqtt-broker
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: mica build <mica@example.invalid>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: micad (= 0.1.0-3), passwd, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: Mica OS local MQTT broker
 An MQTT 3.1.1 broker configured by micad from the mqtt settings. Started by
 micad when MQTT is enabled.
